          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-financial-planning-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Financial Planning UAE</strong>
            <span>Protect your assets before proceedings begin</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-for-expats-in-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce in UAE for Expats</strong>
            <span>Civil law track, home country law and recognition abroad</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-lawyer-dubai/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Lawyer Dubai</strong>
            <span>How to find and choose a UAE family lawyer</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-sticky">
